was blamed for the floods.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing a News Article - <span class=\"italic\">If</span> Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are writing a news article, you can also include conditionals to describe cause and effect as well as hypothetical situations.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are different types of conditional sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Type</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">When To Use</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">How</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Zero Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Real Situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to describe scientific facts\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you put your hand in the fire, it burns.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Real Situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to describe cause and effect situations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If it the weather is nice, we will go to the beach.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unreal Situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to describe hypothetical situations like wishes or dreams\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I were a bird, I would soar above the clouds and fly to other countries.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Third Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unreal Situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to describe past hypothetical situations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I had known your house was damaged in the storm, I would have come over.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If we all work together, we will create change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If there is too much water vapor, there is an increased chance of weather-related natural disasters.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to devastate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cause destruction, damage or harm ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The violent weather devastated the community.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you would read in a news article about weather and the environment.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tsunami", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a very high, large wave in the ocean usually caused by an earthquake under the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The tsunami caused widespread devastation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flash flood", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sudden, large amount of water covering an area of land that is usually dry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The flash flood caught citizens by surprise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "infrastructure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the basic equipment and structures such as roads and bridges that are needed for a country, region", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wild weather affected a lot of major infrastructure in the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "drought", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a long period of time during which there is very little or no rain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Australia has suffered many periods of drought.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to enact", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make a bill officially become part of the law", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Leaders could enact laws that would protect future generations.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "runoff", "type": "name"}, {"content": "water that drains from the land to waterways", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Scientists fear that the Great Barrier Reef could also be in danger of receiving the runoff from the floods.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "vapor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a substance that is in the form of a gas or that consists of very small drops or particles mixed with the air", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As water temperatures continued to rise, the atmosphere was filled with water vapor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to compel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something happen; to force something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hopefully, country leaders will feel compelled to act.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "atmosphere", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the whole mass of air that surrounds the Earth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The atmosphere is made up of gases.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research a natural disaster somewhere in the world that may be connected to global warming.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down notes about the event. Answer <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">what</span>, <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">where</span>, <span class=\"italic\">why</span> questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Now, write a 100 word news article about the event.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include a sentence that explains cause and effect using <span class=\"italic\">If</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include a sentence that uses the Simple Past Passive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the news article aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research natural disaster online and take notes.", "type": "text"}, {"conte