ntent": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Global Warming Unleashes its Fury on the Land Down Under<br/><br/>Numerous communities in eastern Australia were devastated by massive flooding in the early hours of January 10th. In one small town, panicked citizens were forced to evacuate to their rooftops by a tsunami-like flash flood.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "If the local emergency response teams had not been prepared with lifeboats and helicopters, there would have been a significant loss of life. The cost and magnitude are still unclear, though experts suggest that there has been significant damage to major infrastructure. Scientists fear that the Great Barrier Reef could also be in danger of receiving the runoff from the floods. They have suggested to the government that they should start redirecting polluted water away from this sensitive area. The floods were caused by the hot ocean water off the coast of Australia.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn7le17ob08re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "As water temperatures continued to rise, the atmosphere was filled with water vapor. If there is too much water vapor, there is increased chance of weather-related natural disasters and violent storms.<br/><br/>\nShouldn't we, as a global society feel compelled to do more to combat global warming? With the support of citizens, leaders could enact laws that would protect future generations. If we all work together, we will create change.", "id": 3, "time": "53000", "image": "engenn7le17ob08re2img04.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le17ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "A News Article", "id": 1, "time": "", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>What is included in a news article?</li>", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>News articles answer questions.</li>", "id": 3, "time": "43000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Provide additional details.</li>", "id": 4, "time": "74000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Give a witness account when possible.</li>", "id": 5, "time": "94000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>News articles are written in paragraphs and use sentence variety.</li>", "id": 6, "time": "126000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le17ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}